{"page":427,"verses":[{"verse_key":"33:63","surah":33,"ayah":63,"ar_uthmani":"يَسْـَٔلُكَ ٱلنَّاسُ عَنِ ٱلسَّاعَةِ ۖ قُلْ إِنَّمَا عِلْمُهَا عِندَ ٱللَّهِ ۚ وَمَا يُدْرِيكَ لَعَلَّ ٱلسَّاعَةَ تَكُونُ قَرِيبًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"People ask you about the Hour. Say, ‘God alone has knowledge of it.’ How could you [Prophet] know? The Hour may well be near.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَسْـَٔلُكَ","en_gloss":"Ask you","transliteration":"yasaluka","verse_key":"33:63"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسُ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-nāsu","verse_key":"33:63"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَنِ","en_gloss":"about","transliteration":"ʿani","verse_key":"33:63"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلسَّاعَةِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the Hour","transliteration":"l-sāʿati","verse_key":"33:63"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"33:63"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"33:63"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عِلْمُهَا","en_gloss":"its knowledge","transliteration":"ʿil'muhā","verse_key":"33:63"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"(is) with","transliteration":"ʿinda","verse_key":"33:63"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"33:63"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"33:63"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُدْرِيكَ","en_gloss":"will make you know","transliteration":"yud'rīka","verse_key":"33:63"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَعَلَّ","en_gloss":"Perhaps","transliteration":"laʿalla","verse_key":"33:63"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلسَّاعَةَ","en_gloss":"the Hour","transliteration":"l-sāʿata","verse_key":"33:63"},{"pos":14,"ar":"تَكُونُ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"takūnu","verse_key":"33:63"},{"pos":15,"ar":"قَرِيبًا","en_gloss":"near","transliteration":"qarīban","verse_key":"33:63"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٦٣","en_gloss":"(63)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"33:63"}]},{"verse_key":"33:64","surah":33,"ayah":64,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَعَنَ ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ وَأَعَدَّ لَهُمْ سَعِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God has rejected the disbelievers and prepared a blazing fire for them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"33:64"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"33:64"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَعَنَ","en_gloss":"has cursed","transliteration":"laʿana","verse_key":"33:64"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"the disbelievers","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","verse_key":"33:64"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَأَعَدَّ","en_gloss":"and has prepared","transliteration":"wa-aʿadda","verse_key":"33:64"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"33:64"},{"pos":7,"ar":"سَعِيرًا","en_gloss":"a Blaze","transliteration":"saʿīran","verse_key":"33:64"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٦٤","en_gloss":"(64)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"33:64"}]},{"verse_key":"33:65","surah":33,"ayah":65,"ar_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدِينَ فِيهَآ أَبَدًا ۖ لَّا يَجِدُونَ وَلِيًّا وَلَا نَصِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"There they will stay permanently, with no one to befriend or support them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","en_gloss":"Abiding","transliteration":"khālidīna","verse_key":"33:65"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فِيهَآ","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"33:65"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَبَدًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"forever","transliteration":"abadan","verse_key":"33:65"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"33:65"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَجِدُونَ","en_gloss":"they will find","transliteration":"yajidūna","verse_key":"33:65"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلِيًّۭا","en_gloss":"any protector","transliteration":"waliyyan","verse_key":"33:65"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"33:65"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نَصِيرًۭا","en_gloss":"any helper","transliteration":"naṣīran","verse_key":"33:65"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٦٥","en_gloss":"(65)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"33:65"}]},{"verse_key":"33:66","surah":33,"ayah":66,"ar_uthmani":"يَوْمَ تُقَلَّبُ وُجُوهُهُمْ فِى ٱلنَّارِ يَقُولُونَ يَـٰلَيْتَنَآ أَطَعْنَا ٱللَّهَ وَأَطَعْنَا ٱلرَّسُولَا۠","en_translation_id":85,"en":"On the Day when their faces are being turned about in the Fire, they will say, ‘If only we had obeyed God and the Messenger,’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(The) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"33:66"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تُقَلَّبُ","en_gloss":"will be turned about","transliteration":"tuqallabu","verse_key":"33:66"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وُجُوهُهُمْ","en_gloss":"their faces","transliteration":"wujūhuhum","verse_key":"33:66"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"33:66"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلنَّارِ","en_gloss":"the Fire","transliteration":"l-nāri","verse_key":"33:66"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَقُولُونَ","en_gloss":"they will say","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","verse_key":"33:66"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَـٰلَيْتَنَآ","en_gloss":"O we wish","transliteration":"yālaytanā","verse_key":"33:66"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَطَعْنَا","en_gloss":"we (had) obeyed","transliteration":"aṭaʿnā","verse_key":"33:66"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"33:66"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَأَطَعْنَا","en_gloss":"and obeyed","transliteration":"wa-aṭaʿnā","verse_key":"33:66"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلرَّسُولَا۠","en_gloss":"the Messenger","transliteration":"l-rasūlā","verse_key":"33:66"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٦٦","en_gloss":"(66)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"33:66"}]},{"verse_key":"33:67","surah":33,"ayah":67,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟ رَبَّنَآ إِنَّآ أَطَعْنَا سَادَتَنَا وَكُبَرَآءَنَا فَأَضَلُّونَا ٱلسَّبِيلَا۠","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and ‘Lord! We obeyed our masters and our chiefs, and they led us astray.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"And they will say","transliteration":"waqālū","verse_key":"33:67"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَبَّنَآ","en_gloss":"Our Lord","transliteration":"rabbanā","verse_key":"33:67"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِنَّآ","en_gloss":"Indeed, we","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"33:67"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَطَعْنَا","en_gloss":"[we] obeyed","transliteration":"aṭaʿnā","verse_key":"33:67"},{"pos":5,"ar":"سَادَتَنَا","en_gloss":"our chiefs","transliteration":"sādatanā","verse_key":"33:67"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَكُبَرَآءَنَا","en_gloss":"and our great men","transliteration":"wakubarāanā","verse_key":"33:67"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَأَضَلُّونَا","en_gloss":"and they misled us","transliteration":"fa-aḍallūnā","verse_key":"33:67"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلسَّبِيلَا۠","en_gloss":"(from) the Way","transliteration":"l-sabīlā","verse_key":"33:67"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٦٧","en_gloss":"(67)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"33:67"}]},{"verse_key":"33:68","surah":33,"ayah":68,"ar_uthmani":"رَبَّنَآ ءَاتِهِمْ ضِعْفَيْنِ مِنَ ٱلْعَذَابِ وَٱلْعَنْهُمْ لَعْنًا كَبِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Lord! Give them a double punishment and reject them completely.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"رَبَّنَآ","en_gloss":"Our Lord","transliteration":"rabbanā","verse_key":"33:68"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَاتِهِمْ","en_gloss":"Give them","transliteration":"ātihim","verse_key":"33:68"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ضِعْفَيْنِ","en_gloss":"double","transliteration":"ḍiʿ'fayni","verse_key":"33:68"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"[of]","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"33:68"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","en_gloss":"punishment","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābi","verse_key":"33:68"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلْعَنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"and curse them","transliteration":"wal-ʿanhum","verse_key":"33:68"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَعْنًۭا","en_gloss":"(with) a curse","transliteration":"laʿnan","verse_key":"33:68"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَبِيرًۭا","en_gloss":"great","transliteration":"kabīran","verse_key":"33:68"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٦٨","en_gloss":"(68)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"33:68"}]},{"verse_key":"33:69","surah":33,"ayah":69,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ لَا تَكُونُوا۟ كَٱلَّذِينَ ءَاذَوْا۟ مُوسَىٰ فَبَرَّأَهُ ٱللَّهُ مِمَّا قَالُوا۟ ۚ وَكَانَ عِندَ ٱللَّهِ وَجِيهًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Believers, do not be like those who insulted Moses- God cleared him of their allegations and he was highly honoured in God’s eyes.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"33:69"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"33:69"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"33:69"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(Do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"33:69"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَكُونُوا۟","en_gloss":"be","transliteration":"takūnū","verse_key":"33:69"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"like those who","transliteration":"ka-alladhīna","verse_key":"33:69"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ءَاذَوْا۟","en_gloss":"abused","transliteration":"ādhaw","verse_key":"33:69"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مُوسَىٰ","en_gloss":"Musa","transliteration":"mūsā","verse_key":"33:69"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَبَرَّأَهُ","en_gloss":"then Allah cleared him","transliteration":"fabarra-ahu","verse_key":"33:69"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"then Allah cleared him","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"33:69"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِمَّا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"33:69"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قَالُوا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"they said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"33:69"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَكَانَ","en_gloss":"And he was","transliteration":"wakāna","verse_key":"33:69"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"near","transliteration":"ʿinda","verse_key":"33:69"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"33:69"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَجِيهًۭا","en_gloss":"honorable","transliteration":"wajīhan","verse_key":"33:69"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٦٩","en_gloss":"(69)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"33:69"}]},{"verse_key":"33:70","surah":33,"ayah":70,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ ٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَقُولُوا۟ قَوْلًا سَدِيدًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Believers, be mindful of God, speak in a direct fashion and to good purpose,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"33:70"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"33:70"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"33:70"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"Fear","transliteration":"ittaqū","verse_key":"33:70"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"33:70"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَقُولُوا۟","en_gloss":"and speak","transliteration":"waqūlū","verse_key":"33:70"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَوْلًۭا","en_gloss":"a word","transliteration":"qawlan","verse_key":"33:70"},{"pos":8,"ar":"سَدِيدًۭا","en_gloss":"right","transliteration":"sadīdan","verse_key":"33:70"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٧٠","en_gloss":"(70)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"33:70"}]},{"verse_key":"33:71","surah":33,"ayah":71,"ar_uthmani":"يُصْلِحْ لَكُمْ أَعْمَـٰلَكُمْ وَيَغْفِرْ لَكُمْ ذُنُوبَكُمْ ۗ وَمَن يُطِعِ ٱللَّهَ وَرَسُولَهُۥ فَقَدْ فَازَ فَوْزًا عَظِيمًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and He will put your deeds right for you and forgive you your sins. Whoever obeys God and His Messenger will truly achieve a great triumph.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يُصْلِحْ","en_gloss":"He will amend","transliteration":"yuṣ'liḥ","verse_key":"33:71"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"33:71"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَعْمَـٰلَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your deeds","transliteration":"aʿmālakum","verse_key":"33:71"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَيَغْفِرْ","en_gloss":"and forgive","transliteration":"wayaghfir","verse_key":"33:71"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"33:71"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ذُنُوبَكُمْ ۗ","en_gloss":"your sins","transliteration":"dhunūbakum","verse_key":"33:71"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"33:71"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يُطِعِ","en_g